00:05:01.661 --> 00:05:03.506
And are you aware of all the

00:05:03.506 --> 00:05:05.808
vulnerabilities of what you're doing?

00:05:05.808 --> 00:05:08.078
And how are you combating those?

00:05:08.078 --> 00:05:10.387
And, most of all, are
you building a business

00:05:10.387 --> 00:05:12.854
