00:06:15.441 --> 00:06:17.108
- So I think for me,

00:06:18.780 --> 00:06:21.682
I felt super lost the
first 18 years of my life

00:06:21.682 --> 00:06:23.634
because I wasn't a student.

00:06:23.634 --> 00:06:25.567
And in he 80s and 90s there was

00:06:25.567 --> 00:06:28.108
no such thing as
entrepreneurship in America.

00:06:28.108 --> 00:06:30.511
And the only way that you traded was

00:06:30.511 --> 00:06:32.714
based on how good of a student you were.

00:06:32.714 --> 00:06:34.099
And so for the first,

00:06:34.099 --> 00:06:35.657
kind of from six,

00:06:35.657 --> 00:06:38.054
kind of from 10 to 18

00:06:38.054 --> 00:06:40.911
I had a lot of pressure being thrown at me

00:06:40.911 --> 00:06:44.254
by teachers and parents of my friends

00:06:44.254 --> 00:06:46.282
that basically painted me as a loser,

00:06:46.282 --> 00:06:48.303
because I was getting Ds and Fs.

00:06:48.303 --> 00:06:49.136
Even though that I was making

00:06:49.136 --> 00:06:51.827
3000 dollars on weekends
selling baseball cards,

00:06:51.827 --> 00:06:53.413
I was "losing".

00:06:53.413 --> 00:06:54.677
Which you know,

00:06:54.677 --> 00:06:56.293
built up a good skin.

00:06:56.293 --> 00:06:58.534
Made me very prepared
for entrepreneurship.

00:06:58.534 --> 00:07:01.743
The only, only time since I was 22

00:07:01.743 --> 00:07:04.122
for the last 20 years
that I have felt lost

00:07:04.122 --> 00:07:05.427
was when I knew that it was time

00:07:05.427 --> 00:07:07.855
for me to transition out
of my family business

00:07:07.855 --> 00:07:10.741
and I was worried that it
would hurt my dad's feelings.

00:07:10.741 --> 00:07:12.316
Right?

00:07:12.316 --> 00:07:15.187
Luckily, what manifested
in that two to three years

00:07:15.187 --> 00:07:17.351
