00:10:23.751 --> 00:10:24.584
- [Audience Member] Yeah.

00:10:24.584 --> 00:10:25.566
- You got to make choices.

00:10:25.566 --> 00:10:26.399
- [Audience Member] Yeah.

00:10:26.399 --> 00:10:28.477
- You've got two answers.

00:10:28.477 --> 00:10:30.966
