seven pm to midnight,

00:10:34.381 --> 00:10:36.381
or, you deploy patience.

00:10:38.714 --> 00:10:39.969
- [Audience Member] Good point.

00:10:39.969 --> 00:10:42.678
- Cool, but don't underestimate patience.

00:10:42.678 --> 00:10:43.525
- [Audience Member] Okay.

00:10:43.525 --> 00:10:47.275
